# The mortal bulletin board in the Reading Room, west of the temple: reading
# it, writing to it through the line editor, and taking a message off it
# again. gen_board intercepts look/read/write/remove.
Parityone
y
swordfish
swordfish
m
w

1
goto 3000
look
look at board
read 1
write A parity test
This is a message typed by the parity harness.
It has two lines, so that a message body is more than one.
/s
look at board
read 1
remove 1
look at board
# Refusals: a message that is not there, and a removal that is not allowed.
read 9
remove 9
read board
quit
